answer_tet:
Aman ami-nian ne'ebé iha lalehan,
1. Santu kaer Ó-nia naran;
2. Ó-nia Reinu mai;
3. Ó-nia hakarak hetan halo iha rai hanesan iha lalehan;
4. Fó mai ita loron ne'e ita-nia paun loron-loron nian;
5. Perdua ita-nia dívida sira, hanesan ita perdua ita-nia deve-na'in sira;
6. Keta lori ita ba tentasaun, maibé liberta ita hosi aat.
Tanba Reinu, no podér, no glória mak Ó-nian ba nafatin. Ámen.

answer_en:
Our Father which art in heaven,
1. Hallowed be thy name;
2. Thy kingdom come;
3. Thy will be done in earth, as it is in heaven;
4. Give us this day our daily bread;
5. And forgive us our debts, as we forgive our debtors;
6. And lead us not into temptation, but deliver us from evil.
For thine is the kingdom, and the power, and the glory, forever. Amen.
